# Teaching Aids Developed and Used for Education and Training for Online Searching.

**Authors:** Tedd, Lucy A.

## Abstract
Describes audio and digital recording devices, computer-assisted instructional systems, audiovisual aids, and viewdata systems used by British library schools in the instruction of online searching. Twenty-eight references are cited. (FM)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ248997

